msgstr "Circulate to the group’s schools and review the delivery and engagement report for each one."

#: .\reports\templates\reports\landing.html:754
msgid "تدقيق وأرشيف للمجموعة"
msgstr "Group-level auditing and archive"

#: .\reports\templates\reports\landing.html:755
