msgstr "Storage usage, archive years, and the state of every snapshot on one easy-to-revisit screen."

#: .\reports\templates\reports\landing.html:843
msgid "الثقة جزء من التصميم"
msgstr "Trust is part of the design"

#: .\reports\templates\reports\landing.html:844
msgid "الثقة التي تحتاجها الإدارة ليست مجرد كلمة"
msgstr "The assurance management needs is more than a word"

#: .\reports\templates\reports\landing.html:845
